The '''Magma Fields''' are found in the {{zone|Crystal Hollows}}, where {{MobSprite|Yog}}s can spawn. Any location in the {{zone|Crystal Hollows}} at or below {{Coords|X|64|Z}} is considered part of the '''Magma Fields'''.

{{ZoneText|Find Topaz Gemstones.|Watch your temperature!}}

== Purpose ==
* The player's {{Stat|Heat}} gradually rises until they begin to burn and take damage.
* {{item|Lava}} bypasses the {{Item|Lava Talisman}} and {{Item|Fire Talisman}}'s effects, but not the {{item|Campfire Initiate Badge|text=Campfire Badge}}'s effects.
* {{Item|Lava}} allows for fishing {{item|Lava Blaze}}s and {{MobSprite|Lava Pigman|text=Lava Pigmen}}, alongside its own Catches from its separate loot table.
* {{green|4}} of their entrances connect to the {{zone|Crystal Nucleus}} and can house {{zone|Khazad-dûm}}. 

