== Trivia ==
*Early on in the release of the {{zone|Crystal Hollows}} (0.12), lava [[fishing]] in the Magma Fields had vanilla ''Minecraft'' loot tables, leading to lots of glitched items.
*There is a type of random structure generated in Magma Fields which spawns {{MobSprite|Automaton}}s constantly regardless of the area it overlaps with.
* There is a secret [[Achievement]] that can be obtained:
{{CSB|id=achievement|name=Show/Hide Achievement}}
{{CS|id=achievement|mode=begin}}
Throwing an {{item|Eternal Flame Ring}} into the {{item|Lava}} of a certain structure for the first time unlocks {{AchievementLink|The Ring}}
{{CS|id=achievement|mode=end}}
